# ACF Integration

ACF Pro required. Use `get_field()` only — no `have_rows()` or `the_field()`.

## Options page

WP admin: **Theme Settings** (`hotw-theme-settings`), registered in `functions.php` on `acf/init`.

Global fields via `get_field('field_name', 'option')`:

```php
$topbar = get_field('header_topbar', 'option');
```

### Header / Top Bar (`group_hotw_header.json`)

| Tab | ACF group | Status |
|-----|-----------|--------|
| Top Bar | `header_topbar` | Live — tagline, social_links, donate_button (Link; also mobile menu) |
| Navbar | `header_navbar` | Live — logo |

Nav menus stay in **Appearance → Menus** (primary + utility), not ACF.

### Footer (`group_hotw_footer.json`)

| Tab | ACF group | Status |
|-----|-----------|--------|
| Brand | `footer_brand` | Live — logo, mission, social_links |
| Link Columns | `footer_columns` | Live — repeater: heading + links (text, url) |
| Newsletter | `footer_newsletter` | Live — heading, text, email_placeholder, optional CF7 shortcode |
| Contact | `footer_contact` | Live — phone, email |
