## Field group JSON sync

Theme path: `wp-content/themes/custom-theme/acf-json/`

Save/load filters: `hotw_acf_json_save_point` / `hotw_acf_json_load_point` in `functions.php`.

After pulling, sync pending groups in **Custom Fields → Tools** (or Sync notice).

