## Buttons

Use ACF **Link** fields (`return_format: array`). Render `url`, `title`, and `target` — do not split into separate URL + text fields.

## Defaults & fallbacks

- Prefer ACF `default_value` on text/textarea (and link when supported).
- Do **not** mirror content with PHP `$defaults` / `wp_parse_args` static fallbacks for ACF-driven sections.
- Do **not** add Show/Hide or Active toggles — omit empty fields in the template.
- Organize multi-section pages with ACF **Tab** fields (one tab per section).

## Event CPT fields

- `event_date` — return format `Ymd` recommended
- `event_start_time`, `event_end_time` — time pickers
- Legacy: `event_time`, `event_end`

Queried via `hotw_whats_on_get_event_date_for_post()` in `inc/whats-on-events.php`.

## Output escaping

```php
echo esc_html($title);
echo esc_url($link);
echo wp_kses_post($content); // when HTML is intentional
```
